title: "claimbreak"
abstract: "Measures how much segmentation changes cell-type labels in imaging spatial transcriptomics (Xenium,
  CosMx) without ground truth, by labeling each cell from halves of its nuclear counts and from its whole-cell
  counts at the same depth; also stress-tests label-based spatial conclusions under controlled label and count
  errors."
